#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:46
msgid ""
"Accepted asynchronous requests borrow their metadata and buffers until "
"acquire-observed `SETTLED`. Rejected admission retains no new borrow or "
"residual hardware effects. Cancellation and deadlines request withdrawal; "
"the caller must continue the required service. Failed drain retains "
"`QUARANTINED` storage and recovery responsibility. The provider detaches "
"actual references before its final release-publication. Consumers, controls "
"and observers must also be joined before their own storage is reused. See "
"the [shared lifecycle contract](../explanation/ownership.md)."
msgstr ""
"Accepted asynchronous requests borrow their metadata and buffers until "
"acquire-observed `SETTLED`. Rejected admission retains no new borrow or "
"residual hardware effects. Cancellation and deadlines request withdrawal; "
"the caller must continue the required service. Failed drain retains "
"`QUARANTINED` storage and recovery responsibility. The provider detaches "
"actual references before its final release-publication. Consumers, controls "
"and observers must also be joined before their own storage is reused. See "
"the [shared lifecycle contract](../explanation/ownership.md)."

